            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "A game of boardroom politics, lesbian romance, and schoolgirl noir. <br><br>9 AM Monday morning. A report lands on your desk: <u>Jeanette</u>'s monogrammed silver locket has gone missing. The last time she definitely remembers having it, she was walking in the <u>Field</u> with her friend <u>Susan</u>. Shifty hallmate<u> Ashley</u> had also been admiring the locket recently.<br>Do you:<br><br>Drag <u>Ashley</u> in for interrogation?<br>Comb the <u>Field</u> for clues?<br>Try to stimulate <u>Jeanette</u>'s memory?<br>Put <u>Susan</u> under surveillance?<br><br>Solve the case quickly, and everyone will applaud your leadership. Be too heavy-handed in your approach, and public opinion will turn against you. Let a thief slip through your fingers to strike again, and the whole school's reputation will suffer.",
            "about_the_game": "A game of boardroom politics, lesbian romance, and schoolgirl noir. <br><br>9 AM Monday morning. A report lands on your desk: <u>Jeanette</u>'s monogrammed silver locket has gone missing. The last time she definitely remembers having it, she was walking in the <u>Field</u> with her friend <u>Susan</u>. Shifty hallmate<u> Ashley</u> had also been admiring the locket recently.<br>Do you:<br><br>Drag <u>Ashley</u> in for interrogation?<br>Comb the <u>Field</u> for clues?<br>Try to stimulate <u>Jeanette</u>'s memory?<br>Put <u>Susan</u> under surveillance?<br><br>Solve the case quickly, and everyone will applaud your leadership. Be too heavy-handed in your approach, and public opinion will turn against you. Let a thief slip through your fingers to strike again, and the whole school's reputation will suffer.",
            "short_description": "Command your minions to solve mysteries and cover up scandals in a high-class boarding school, where the competition is cut-throat and image is everything. But be careful - one of your minions is a traitor.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês",
